<title>UK: Lehman sets warrants on Porsche AG.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets warrants on Porsche AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance S.A. said it has issued five million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on Porsche AG preferred stock, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   10.MAR.97		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, STUTT, DUSS    SPOT REF     1835 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   MATURITY    STRIKE   PRICE    PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> SPRINTER III 30.DEC.97   2000 DEM 3.24 DEM 26.65 PCT 5.66 X</p>
<p> SPRINTER  IV 30.DEC.97   2200 DEM 2.61 DEM 34.11 PCT 7.03 X</p>
<p> MARATHON   V 15.JAN.99   2250 DEM 4.00 DEM 44.41 PCT 4.59 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
